  <item>
    <title>315医美乱象还是说轻了！让我来！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d8701cdd11f9c8c13f2630</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d8701cdd11f9c8c13f2630</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Mar 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>以下朋友圈截图可能会导致大家生理不适，先跟大家道歉，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目想做很久了，正好315晚会曝光了一些医美乱象，作为在医美行业10年的依依，也有很多话想说，也有很多爆料。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想讨论一下，究竟是什么在引导我们的审美，引导我们进入一些畸形的整容价值观，也许这期节目播出会导致无数业内攻击，但是我们觉得不吐不快。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-ScmfsLAtITruwy-EUPwnmZ9iD.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhiFwBM-3yscFQHBG_lCX0pHc278.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6km6WsLY-elX5ZzTzF30w7-MYE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq6zih-CcRj8-v1LwxdWNMLgTiam.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-Oz04AEZD33WuCVQ2Mhy2bxX71.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYTZunXVtQx6Jhnwsownr7VmAJB.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJ_mWP1QGK0QHlYSmgmwyXdvaet.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFo-VanIEHN4GnCQo843JStGuw9.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_lLOSsHrqWgqAjLxycAduYEEEp.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIlYAOM6H_4e9ksFOWn-YMv8i7C.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjfBLxbSKMWqJzn1Pihrp4D2GMbN.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRollKT_xpbrgLvw10QImLjJWKp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 吸血式佣金 曾经有机构给我85%的分成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 为什么维权那么困难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 你以为你在货比三家，其实你找的都是同一个机构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> 手术台背后的离谱故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 贷款整容的套路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 请“大师”算命整容？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 绝对震碎你三观的“医美朋友圈”大公开</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/674816b64df1d7d4a7802ab1/llOb48bABb3EjM_xm7aawWTH5tEn.m4a" length="117190581" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtP8uUQpyRhcpSDVsUg5g6RYYzQs.png"/>
