    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们聊聊紫微斗数，屎老师是完全小白不了解，依依是刚接触不久，那我们就聊一期新手向吧~欢迎大家讨论与提问~</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：观星棉花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 不要无厘头去算命，算命不是大师很厉害，是你活的很准。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 怎么辨别江湖骗子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a> 如果命是注定的，我们努力还有用吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 怎么发现我们生命中的“贵人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 整形真的有“整运”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">52:10</a> 相亲或者认识新人的时候是不是可以先看八字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4270">71:10</a> 现场看看盘</span></p>]]></description>
