  <item>
    <title>#001 八年暴食症的自述 自救指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674dc51e0ed328720a046417</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674dc51e0ed328720a046417</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 15:49:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>身体：暴食患者的战场</span></p><span></span><p><span>著名的美国心理学家与作家Margo Maine，</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾经出版过一本畅销书《Body Wars》，这本书的标题，</span></p><span></span><p><span>很生动的点出暴食患者所发生的问题：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“以自己的身体作为完美主义与生理欲望间无止境的战场”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>碰巧今天我们3位主持都经历过暴食的困扰，</span></p><span></span><p><span>继而想跟大家聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 怎么定义暴食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 暴食的几个阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 厌食和暴食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 买过期临期食物来嚼吐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> 词语定义传播的社会学现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> 伴随一生的心理准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2866">47:46</a> 暴食带来的流量和暴食造假博流量</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkv891Ck-1IanVSocNYp6P6hzMK_.m4a" length="103054949" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtP8uUQpyRhcpSDVsUg5g6RYYzQs.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
